    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the alcoholic beverage control law, in relation to penalties for the provision, by a licensee, of an alcoholic beverage to a person under the age of 21",
    "basePrintNo": "S6434",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6434-2013",
